<Paragraph>Growth Circuit is a community of builders, marketing engineers, and growth folks who want to learn from each other. We host monthly meetups, virtual show &amp; tells, and smaller dinners in New York City. <Br /><Br />See you soon!<Br />Nick &amp; Lucy</Paragraph>
